%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor agent as Agent / MCP client
    participant mcp as MCP server
    participant app as App
    participant client as ankiclient.Client

    agent->>mcp: tools/list
    mcp-->>agent: Tools and RPC schemas
    Note right of mcp: No worker started

    agent->>mcp: col_open(collection)
    mcp->>app: ColOpen(options)
    app->>client: Start + OpenCollection
    Note over app,client: Keep collection and connection open
    app-->>mcp: Prepared client
    mcp-->>agent: Collection handle

    loop Calls using the same handle
        agent->>mcp: Workflow or API tool(handle)
        mcp->>client: Connection()
        mcp->>app: Existing method(connection)
        app->>client: Native RPCs
        app-->>mcp: Result
        mcp-->>agent: JSON result
    end

    agent->>mcp: col_close(handle) or disconnect
    mcp->>client: Stop()
    Note over mcp,client: Publish enabled archive, close storage and stop owned worker
    Note over app,client: Database writes are immediate.<br/>Path calls open and close<br/>a collection per operation.
